# The whole tree is LF, including the .bat launchers, which work as-is on Windows.
# Normalising to LF keeps contributors on other platforms from producing whole-file diffs —
# the exact noise vendor\LTX-2 shows today (327 "modified" files that are only line endings).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pt binary
